    context: ['An affectionate message in an ongoing relationship may need only a warm reply. The same words after a long gap may leave you wondering why contact is restarting.', 'A sentiment does not automatically resolve an earlier conflict. You can acknowledge the feeling while still raising the issue that matters to you.'],
