    context: ['If you already have a relevant message, you can refer to it calmly. If there is no clear record, distinguish what you remember from what you can verify rather than forcing certainty about the past.', 'If disagreements repeatedly become insults or blanket claims that your perceptions cannot be trusted, consider the effect on you and whether respectful discussion is possible. You can set a boundary without assigning a diagnosis.'],
